; Fluffy white Persian from "input/white_persian.avif", drawn by hand.
; Proportions and every pose follow refs/local/cat_ref/move.pxl (down 4, side 8, up 4 frames).
; Persian touches: bushy 3px tail in front/back views, 1px chest ruff, amber eyes under a dark lid.
name white_persian
size 32 32
scale 2
outline K
layout
down_0 down_1 down_2 down_3
left_0 left_1 left_2 left_3 left_4 left_5 left_6 left_7
right_0 right_1 right_2 right_3 right_4 right_5 right_6 right_7
up_0 up_1 up_2 up_3
palette
K #1e161c outline
W #f7f2ea white fur
H #ffffff back light
c #dcc8b4 cream shade
P #ef8f99 nose
e #f2adb2 inner ear
Y #d4952a amber eye

